### Prerequisites:

- Before requesting a device addition, please ensure there is not already a request for the device among the open issues.
- Make sure your Homey is upgraded to firmware v5 or higher.
- You need a physical example of the device.

### Device Information

- Device Name: `Provide the name of the device`
- Device Model: _TZ3000_jl7qyupf
- Device Description: 2-gang buildin switch, but Homey only shows 1 channel and no energy information.
- Link to device image: (https://smartgateways.nl/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Tuya-ZigBee-3.0-schakelaar-geen-nuldraad-2weg-Voice-Control-Google-Home-Amazon-Alexa-Home-Assistant-Zigbee2mqtt-300x300.jpg)

