### Describe the bug

When adding a blitzwolf plug (bw-shp15) it get's recognized as a generic zigbee device (while the model appears to be included in the app)

### To Reproduce

Steps to reproduce the behavior:

Add a new tuya zigbee device, after following the installation steps it gets recognized as a generic zigbee device (without metering properties, while the device does have these properties).

### Expected behavior

Identification as tuya zigbee

### App and Homey version

Homey Pro (Early 2023)
Versie 12.1.1

Tuya Zigbee
v0.1.45


Problem appears for multiple of these devices.

